## What to deliver

Build the belt sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: a dark two-lane metal belt with side
rails and East-pointing amber chevrons, the chevron pattern scrolling right by
the same step each frame so frames 0→7 loop seamlessly and the segment tiles
horizontally. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs
are your finished submission.
